{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t港股連升3日。恒生指數曾升逾150點，半日收報23515點，升121點，升幅0.52%。主板成交額近1153億元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n科技指數半日升近1%，報3876點。ATMXJ全線上升，京東升近5%，阿里巴巴升近1%，重返100元大關。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n內需、汽車及博彩股造好，海底撈升逾6%，是半日表現最好藍籌。理想、李寧及銀娛升逾3%至逾4%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n晶片及AI相關股份受壓，智譜、聯想集團、華虹宏力及天數智芯跌逾5%至近7%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n三桶油跌逾2%或以上。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:42:31.465371+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:24:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:59:11.087534+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:38:59.986534+00:00","content_hash":"a01652f981fbddbecd24f693b1f62345aa18aea897c1997422ac2491d78f9afd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}